Renouveler après chaque baignade, après avoir transpiré ou s''être essuyé.',15900,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/shop-sl-02794-01-bariesun-tinted-cream-spf50---golden-tint-50ml--1.jpg?v=1790074640',10,1,'7446575775919','42271265456303','https://beautymarket.ma/products/uriage-bariesun-spf50-creme-teintee-doree-50ml',1,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/shop-sl-02794-01-bariesun-tinted-cream-spf50---golden-tint-50ml--1.jpg?v=1790074640","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/3661434027628_1.jpg?v=1790074640","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/fr-fr-uriage-b-bariesun-3661434027628-en-variation-01-2-1780479073.png?v=1790074640"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO products(name,brand,category,description,price,image,stock,active,source_product_id,source_variant_id,source_url,source_available,images_json,sku) VALUES ('Vichy normaderm sérum anti-imperfections probio-bha 30ml','Vichy','Solaires','SÉRUM ANTI-IMPERFECTIONS VISAGE.
PEAU À TENDANCE ACNÉIQUE.
CORRIGE LES IMPERFECTIONS.
EXFOLIE EN DOUCEUR.
ACCÉLÈRE LE RENOUVELLEMENT CELLULAIRE.





Issu de l’expertise de la science de l''Exposome, ce sérum anti-imperfections est hautement concentré en actifs dermatologiques pour corriger les boutons rouges et points noirs causés par l''acné hormonale. Il contient de l’acide salicylique et de l’acide glycolique, deux ingrédients exfoliants à l’effet peeling doux, et des fractions de probiotiques cultivés dans l''eau volcanique de Vichy pour booster la régénération cellulaire et renforcer la barrière cutanée.',31600,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Plandetravail10_d50469bf-836d-4629-9511-6393d54ca4b9.png?v=1752176297',10,1,'7446575906991','42271265816751','https://beautymarket.ma/products/vichy-normaderm-serum-anti-imperfections-probio-bha',0,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Plandetravail10_d50469bf-836d-4629-9511-6393d54ca4b9.png?v=1752176297","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Plandetravail11_a2b21adc-2bc4-4a03-a4a3-d55ba9800714.png?v=1752176297","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Plandetravail18_a19b0dbc-ec9f-4aff-baef-9160d89bc797.png?v=1752176297","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Plandetravail9_373c92df-55fd-41e4-8646-4aad1aab6c77.png?v=1752176297","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Plandetravail13_351bca46-6cf4-4d4c-9aab-3d52c539f36a.png?v=1752176297","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Plandetravail14_f789407a-d9e0-4260-9d32-d264f7cde4b2.png?v=1752176297","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Plandetravail17_97697e21-1d07-4676-89cb-813b336d91eb.png?v=1752176297","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Plandetravail12_599e98ac-875f-401e-b462-ffd0c1c70b39.png?v=1752176297","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Plandetravail1_78121244-c21a-4211-ad18-0118633819cb.png?v=1752176297","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Plandetravail3_ce2f0246-6343-4b07-857f-1103a8fe6473.png?v=1752176297","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Plandetravail2_34d6432c-6d1d-4c58-994f-7284fc49fea5.png?v=1752176297","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Plandetravail8_5ad077c4-a042-4062-ac97-30febb200202.png?v=1752176258"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO products(name,brand,category,description,price,image,stock,active,source_product_id,source_variant_id,source_url,source_available,images_json,sku) VALUES ('URIAGE BARIESUN SPRAY SPF 50+ 200ML','Uriage','Solaires','Grâce à un complexe filtrant très performant, ce spray apporte une très haute protection solaire contre les UVA, les UVB et prévient du dessèchement cutané. Sa texture légère, non grasse et agréablement parfumée garantit un plaisir d’utilisation renouvelé à chaque application. Ce soin garantit une haute sécurité, une grande tolérance et une pénétration rapide.

Protège contre les UV

Son complexe de filtres assure une très haute protection contre les UV. Ce soin garantit une photostabilité prouvée et une large couverture UVB-UVA.

Prévient du dessèchement cutané

Enrichi en Aquaspongines et en Eau Thermale d’Uriage, le spray assure une protection intense contre le dessèchement.',18900,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/spray50.png?v=1690816466',10,1,'7446575939759','42271265980591','https://beautymarket.ma/products/uriage-bariesun-spray-spf-50-200ml',1,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/spray50.png?v=1690816466"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO products(name,brand,category,description,price,image,stock,active,source_product_id,source_variant_id,source_url,source_available,images_json,sku) VALUES ('URIAGE BARIESUN SPF50+ STICK INVISIBLE 8G','Uriage','Visage','Uriage Bariésun Invisible Stick Unscented SPF50+ 8G has a very creamy stick texture with high sun protection perfect for more sensitive areas of the body. More specifically, this product protects areas like the nose and earlobes or more sensitive areas of the body like scars. By containing a new complex of latest-generation filters, it provides very high protection against UV rays. In particular, this stick guarantees photostability and broad UVB and UVA coverage so that even sensitive skin can be perfectly protected. Furthermore, this product itself becomes a very nice sunscreen, precise and easy to use and apply to the skin. In turn, its invisible finish becomes imperceptible on the skin and its shape itself becomes travel-friendly. Specifically, this product gains a special benefit mainly to effectively protect athletes.

Its composition also has ingredients such as Vitamins C and E. In this sense, these two properties rich in antioxidants guarantee greater effectiveness of the UVA/UVB filters of this sunscreen. In addition, they also protect the skin against free radical damage. Furthermore, Shea Butter, Wheat Protein and Sunflower Oil deeply nourish and hydrate the skin to keep it as healthy as possible while protected from the sun. All in all, this stick not only becomes a practical ally against UV damage, but also takes care of the most sensitive skin in an exemplary way.',10900,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Sanstitre-2_48c07dd9-f29a-441e-ba00-630d3de47255.png?v=1689861173',10,1,'7446576201903','42271267225775','https://beautymarket.ma/products/uriage-bariesun-spf50-stick-invisible-8g',0,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/Sanstitre-2_48c07dd9-f29a-441e-ba00-630d3de47255.png?v=1689861173"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO products(name,brand,category,description,price,image,stock,active,source_product_id,source_variant_id,source_url,source_available,images_json,sku) VALUES ('URIAGE BARIESUN SPF50+ LAIT ENFANT 100 ML','Uriage','Solaires','Bariésun combine un complexe filtrant très performant et deux brevets dermatologiques pour protéger la peau et prévenir les dommages cellulaires induits par les UVA, UVB et la lumière bleue.
Ce lait très haute protection à la texture légère et résistante à l’eau garantit un fini invisible et un plaisir d’utilisation renouvelé à chaque application. Ce soin démontre une haute sécurité, une haute tolérance et une absorption rapide.

