Délicatement nacré de bronze, il sublime le bronzage et révèle l''éclat de la peau et du cheveux.',14700,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/vahema_monoi_bronze_1080x1080_a712d183-1fce-4faf-af32-f33f79de8ddf.png?v=1782476843',10,1,'7582756962479','42652405170351','https://beautymarket.ma/products/vahema-monoi-de-tahiti-soin-satin-bronze',1,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/vahema_monoi_bronze_1080x1080_a712d183-1fce-4faf-af32-f33f79de8ddf.png?v=1782476843"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
