Brossez pendant deux minutes, en insistant sur les zones tachées.

Rincez soigneusement.',3700,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/LLLLLL.jpg?v=1722615000',10,1,'8048653631663','44233984180399','https://beautymarket.ma/products/progyum-dentifrice-blancheur-charbon-xylitol-75ml',1,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/LLLLLL.jpg?v=1722615000","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/PPPPP_9ec1402a-ff2b-4ebe-9b8e-5ea00f42e810.jpg?v=1722614985"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
